e},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_n=\\bigwedge_{k\\le n}\\eta(\\bar k)","display":false},{"tex":"g(n)>n","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\chi_{g(n)}\\vdash f(\\chi_n)","display":false},{"tex":"T+E_\\eta\\vdash f(\\chi_n)","display":false},{"tex":"g(n)>n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\nvdash\\chi_n\\to f(\\chi_n)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\nvdash\\chi_n\\to\\chi_{g(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"h(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"h(n+1)=g(h(n))","display":false},{"tex":"(h(n),h(n+1)]","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"Z_{\\eta,H}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\mapsto\\eta(\\bar k)","display":false}],"bytes":4552,"backlinks":[{"id":"5698dbb792dca9ba","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 Corollary4.4。由 [[67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization]] 得相对 $T$ 非 i.a. 的 $U=T+E_\\eta$。若 $U$ 有绝对不可冗余r.e.公理化 $Y$，有限性给有限 $Y_0\\subseteq Y$ 使 $Y_0\\vdash T$。把 $Y_0$ 压成单个合取 $\\theta$，则相对 $T$ 的 $\\{\\theta\\}\\cup(Y\\setminus Y_0)$ 与 $U$ 等价。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-uniform-reflection]]；[[../67-thm-reflection-principle]]；[[../67-thm-reflection-hierarchy]]；[[../67-df-iterated-local-reflection]]；[[../67-thm-reflection-strict-hierarchy]]；[[../67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]；[[../67-thm-montague-tarski-axiomatization]]；[[../67-thm-nonirredundant-axiomatization]]；[[../67-thm-irredundant-complexity-gap]]"}],"outgoing":["d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","1b2d614db2eb3b87","3dfb8d24daf96156","4acca08be2551459","9c200c8ec3685766","fde932e35a45d307","851cd80e64893935","b59d5ff6e43660a9"]}